{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39164","headline":"覩军回戈 · 韦庄","name":"覩军回戈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关中羣盗已心离，关外犹闻羽檄飞。\n御苑绿莎嘶战马，禁城寒月捣征衣。\n漫教韩信兵涂地，不及刘琨啸解围。\n昨日屯军还夜遁，满车空载洛神归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}